# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# The widgets page opened cold after a boot, then again warm (11-11: the first opening stalled ~430 ms mid-swipe in the
# pages-fresh2 recording). With rec=4 touch_lat=1: the recording fetched at the "wait 20", SpringBoard's long run-loop
# turns in the console (devices/akita/tools/tl-symbols.py). RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.widgetsopen.
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 38
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 4 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 3
/redwood/bin/rwtouch swipe 0.15 0.5 0.85 0.5 300 wait 4 swipe 0.85 0.5 0.15 0.5 300 wait 3
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 20
